Hi Richard, 

This is a bug.  I checked in a fix for release version 1.14.3.  Both of the following should evaluate to TRUE

crlmm:::isValidCdfName("human1mv1c")
crlmm:::isValidCdfName("human1mv1cCrlmm")

thanks-

Rob


