>>>>>>>> When doing MSA, most people might rather be interested in the
>>>>>>>> consensus sequence. E.g. in the context of conservation between
>>>>>>>> species.
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> So write.PairwiseAlignedXStringSet() and write.MultipleAlignment()
