From jmacdon at uw.edu  Sat Jul 28 05:30:49 2012
From: jmacdon at uw.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Fri, 27 Jul 2012 23:30:49 -0400
Subject: [BioC] LIMMA -- obtaining values used to calculate lfc
