That is your hint ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

You need to have the netcdf headers available and in your path. Looking 
at the dependencies for xcms and then following the links to ncdf 
brought me to this page:

http://cran.fhcrc.org/web/packages/ncdf/INSTALL

Which may be helpful.


Best,

Jim



